Z||000003||2xsess||02-14-2001||07:59 PM||||Well, I could have volunteeered to meet him but... I was already slated to go out to the field for Monday and Tuesday. So I missed his visit. It did cause quite a bit of mayham here on the base though, could park our cars in the usual spots and all. And most people got half the day off due to the amount of roads that were closed off. <P>Kind of glad I wasn't here for the headache.<P>He did make a lot of wonderful promises!! Can't wait to see if he follows through.<P>------------------<BR>Jeff<BR>AOL IM : Only2xsess<BR>       <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/2xsess.gif">      <BR> <A HREF="http://kresgeus.homestead.com/FieroPage.html" TARGET=_blank>Visit My Website</A>||||reg||1
